      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FREASON (7) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when a nose from the winner in second over 1740m at Riverina Paceway. Will need a bit of luck negotiating a very wide starting position. Meets a similar line up and he is a strong winning hope. SATELLITE SIMBA (2) has had a string of second row draws so is much better served by this barrier. Look for big improvement. SEE ME NO MORE (9) drew a wide gate last start and was never a genuine threat, beaten 8 metres into sixth at Menangle . Will enjoy a pretty soft run from this draw, with the sprint lane to play a big role. Meets a comparable field and he can figure in the finish. MICKEY BE NIMBLE (6) has each-way claims after turning in a better effort last start to finish third at Newcastle. LETSTACOBOUTIT (10) is in the mix following a respectable third at his most recent appearance at Wagga.",
